[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891934\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892134\">7025A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892213\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892170\">7040A04</a></p><p>1. Remove the gear selection and engagement flexible cable ends\nfrom the gear lever.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts securing the manual gear control lever.</p><p>3. Remove the manual gear control lever.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034746.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the manual control lever.</p><p>Tighten the bolts securing the control\nlever.</p><p>Connect the two flexible transmission cable\nends to the lever.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892170\">7040A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892213\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892134\">7025A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891934\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892173\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892177\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892176\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891974\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892175\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892180\">7040A96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892101\">7010M16</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892291\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891963\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891960\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892172\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892286\">7065C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891550\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892171\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p>"]]